1. Created server service(deamon) -> sudo vim /usr/bin/asyn_websocket_server.py
    - sudo vim /lib/systemd/system/async_fedres_server.service:
        [Unit]
Description=Async_Fedres_Server Service
After=multi-user.target
Conflicts=getty@tty1.service

        [Service]
        Type=simple
        ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /usr/bin/asyn_websocket_server.py
        StandardInput=tty-force

        [Install]
        WantedBy=multi-user.target
    -  sudo systemctl daemon-reload
    -  sudo systemctl enable async_fedres_server.service
    -  sudo systemctl start  async_fedres_server.service

  2. Create client service(deamon) -> sudo vim /usr/bin/get_value_from_table.py
    - sudo vim /lib/systemd/system/fedresurs_client.service
[Unit]
Description=Monitor_Task_Table Service
After=multi-user.target
Conflicts=getty@tty1.service

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/python3 /usr/bin/get_value_from_table.py
StandardInput=tty-force

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
    -  sudo systemctl daemon-reload
    -  sudo systemctl enable fedresurs.service
    -  sudo systemctl start fedresurs.service


How it work
1) client(get_value_from_table) monitor DB
2) if new data with status active is appeared, client pack data to dict -> serialized(to byte) and send to server(dict representation)
3) server get data deserialized -> write to files according type
4) than server run spiders
5) every spider read data from it's own directory and file/ get post data for parsing